reveal valuable context, preserve multiple valid approaches instead of forcing premature resolution (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/architecture/preserving-productive-tensions/SKILL.md)\n- Pulling Updates from Skills Repository: Sync local skills repository with upstream changes from obra/superpowers-skills (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/meta/pulling-updates-from-skills-repository/SKILL.md)\n- Remembering Conversations: Search previous Claude Code conversations for facts, patterns, decisions, and context using semantic or text search (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/collaboration/remembering-conversations/SKILL.md)\n- Requesting Code Review: Dispatch code-reviewer subagent to review implementation against plan or requirements before proceeding (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/collaboration/requesting-code-review/SKILL.md)\n- Root Cause Tracing: Systematically trace bugs backward through call stack to find original trigger (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/debugging/root-cause-tracing/SKILL.md)\n- Scale Game: Test at extremes (1000x bigger/smaller, instant/year-long) to expose fundamental truths hidden at normal scales (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/problem-solving/scale-game/SKILL.md)\n- Sharing Skills: Contribute skills back to upstream via branch and PR (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/meta/sharing-skills/SKILL.md)\n- Simplification Cascades: Find one insight that eliminates multiple components - \"if this is true, we don't need X, Y, or Z\" (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/problem-solving/simplification-cascades/SKILL.md)\n- Subagent-Driven Development: Execute implementation plan by dispatching fresh subagent for each task, with code review between tasks (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/collaboration/subagent-driven-development/SKILL.md)\n- Systematic Deb